# box-type (M7): typing into a's number box (330, 408.5, 107 x 32 at 1440 x 900, the reference's
# DOM). A click (a press that doesn't travel 3 px) opens its field with "1.00" selected; "2.5"
# replaces it; Enter applies it, a jump the plane springs to (FV 05), and hands the focus back to
# the box with the keyboard's ring and its keys' tip. a off its default brings ↺ into the row (its
# flip toggle moves left) and Reset all into the Transform head. The shot after Enter waits out
# React's spring (0.702 s), which the port draws at once until M10.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 383 424
wait 16
shot open
type "2.5"
wait 16
shot typed
key Enter
wait 1000
shot applied
